course: dictionary
lesson: 10869
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer means. Vicuna is one of these words. It can name an animal, or it can name the soft wool that comes from that animal.
explain: As an animal, a vicuna is a wild South American creature related to the llama and alpaca. It is small, slim and light brown, and lives high in the Andes mountains. As wool, vicuna means very fine, soft and expensive cloth made from its fleece.
explain: Look at the clues around the word. In «herds of vicunas», herds are groups of living animals, so vicunas must be animals. In «vicuna wool», the word wool tells you it is the material. Ask yourself: is this a creature, or is it cloth? Then try your meaning in the sentence.
fact: A vicuna is a wild South American animal related to the llama and alpaca.
fact: The vicuna is small, slim and light brown, and lives high in the Andes mountains.
fact: Vicuna also means very fine, soft, expensive wool or cloth made from the animal's fleece.
fact: The Inca protected vicunas, but later they were hunted nearly to extinction for their wool.
fact: Today vicunas are protected again, so they are no longer hunted for wool.
exercise: «Llamas and alpacas were bred from wild guanacos and vicunas in the Andes thousands of years ago.» Where did the vicunas live? | In the Sahara desert | *In the Andes mountains | Under the sea | In the middle of a big city
exercise: «The scarf was made of pure vicuna, soft and very expensive.» What does vicuna mean here? | A small, light brown animal | A mountain village in the Andes | A kind of llama farm | *Very fine, soft wool or cloth
exercise: Find and copy one word from the example sentence that names a wild animal. | thousands | mostly | annoyed | *vicunas
test: «The herd of vicunas climbed the steep mountain path.» In «herd of vicunas», what is a herd? | A kind of wool | A type of spit | *A group of animals living together | A high mountain
test: Which sentence describes a vicuna, the animal? | It is a tall tree with green leaves | It is a large black bird that cannot fly | *It is a small, slim, light brown animal | It is a soft cloth sold in shops
exam: «The vicuna grazed high in the Andes, far above the snowline.» What does vicuna mean in this sentence? | The wool | *The animal | A mountain village | A cloth coat
